  &lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Champion-Rebelle-(R&#244;deur).html&quot; title=&quot;Champion rebelle&quot;&gt;Champion rebelle&lt;/a&gt; (MCA)&lt;/li&gt;
